This application retrieves financial market data from Yahoo Finance
(https://finance.yahoo.com) via its publicly accessible API endpoints.

  • Yahoo Finance data is the property of Yahoo Inc. and/or its data providers.
  • Use of Yahoo Finance data is subject to Yahoo's Terms of Service:
    https://legal.yahoo.com/us/en/yahoo/terms/otos/index.html
  • This software does not store, redistribute, or sell Yahoo Finance data.
    All data is fetched at runtime on behalf of the end user and is used solely
    for display purposes within the application.
  • The authors of this software make no representation that the use of Yahoo
    Finance data through this application complies with Yahoo's Terms of Service
    in any particular jurisdiction or use case. Users are solely responsible
    for ensuring their use of this application complies with applicable terms
    and local laws.
  • This software is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
    Yahoo Inc.

